  "tariffVersionAtCapture": "2026.09",
  "method": "Driven through the public simulator wizard at belastingen.fenb.be/ui/public/vkb/simulatie with a real Chrome browser, one case at a time, serially, spaced 8 to 12 seconds apart. The JSON API behind the wizard returns HTTP 403 to any request that does not originate from the app itself, including same origin fetch from the page, so every value below was produced by the wizard exactly as a member of the public would run it. No proxy, no captcha service, no retry on failure.",
  "fixedInputs": "personenwagen, natural person, no chassis number lookup, simulation year 2026. Every case was registered on 15/09/2026 unless stated otherwise, which puts the assessment period in the 1 July 2026 indexation window (01/09/2026 to 31/08/2027).",
  "notes": [
    "The simulator asks for the NEDC CO2 value when the first registration is before 01/01/2021 and the WLTP value from 01/01/2021 onwards. The boundary was pinned to the day by reading the wizard question label at 01/10/2020, 31/12/2020 and 01/01/2021 without submitting a calculation.",
    "engineAtCapture and deltaAtCapture are a snapshot of core/tax.js at tariff version 2026.09 on 2026-09-01. They are the baseline, not a target. When the engine is corrected these deltas should shrink towards zero.",
    "For LPG the simulator reports the base road tax and the accijnscompenserende belasting separately. roadTaxTotal is the sum, which is what the engine returns as one number.",
    "Do not edit the official block. It is measured ground truth."
  ],
